    ,HOW DOES WATER REACH OUR HOMES8

  ,THE WATER USED IN HOMES COMES FROM
TWO SOURCES4
  ,UNDER THE GROUND3 WELLS1 TUBE WELLS
AND SO ON4
  ,ON THE SURFACE OF THE GROUND3
SPRINGS1 WATERFALLS1 STREAMS1 RIVERS1
LAKES AND SO ON4
  ,SURFACE WATER IS CLEANED AT A
FILTRATION PLANT AND THEN REACHES OUR
HOMES THROUGH A PIPELINE4
  ,PICTURE3 ,IN THIS DIAGRAM THERE IS A
BIG BLUE WATER TANK ON THE LEFT4 ,A PIPE
RUNS FROM IT TO THREE FILTER TANKS AND
THEN TO TWO SMALL BLUE FILTERS4 ,FROM
THERE THE CLEAN WATER TRAVELS THROUGH A
PIPELINE TO A HOUSE ON THE RIGHT4
  ,DO YOU KNOW8 ,FILTERING AND BOILING
WATER ARE WAYS OF CLEANING WATER4
